{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>半山羅便臣道昨日（21日）發生一宗驚險交通意外。網上流傳一段車Cam片段，事發於昨日下午約1時，一名45歲母親拖着5歲女兒，在羅便臣道10號樂怡閣對開，於小巴車頭位置橫過馬路，豈料一輛客貨車突然從小巴後方涉嫌違規超越雙白線「爬頭」，將母女二人撞倒，母親被撞後即時爬起，並慌忙檢查倒地不起的女兒狀況。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-22-15h18m49s827.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KbQxcZPHlG1792653730.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>受傷母親右手及頸部疼痛、左手肘及膝蓋擦傷，而5歲女童則鼻及左腳擦傷，幸二人均保持清醒，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院治理，涉事客貨車司機為一名64歲本地男子，案件目前仍在調查中。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-22-15h18m52s921.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026C5FppyVTfM1792653736.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:04:59.045586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:45.091466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:58:12.184583+00:00","content_hash":"28ad60128dafde4172fe0b081ee3dcf45f5888dca50b3dff830ece4d0e0bd0bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}